Package: corium
Architecture: amd64 arm64
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: Minimal initramfs init for a read-only Carapace root
 Corium is a minimal Linux initramfs PID 1. It discovers and mounts a
 read-only Carapace root filesystem, then executes /sbin/init.
 The host binary is installed in /usr/bin/corium for image builders to
 include as /init in an initramfs.
